# Siya visuals — slide-by-slide approval gate

When the user asks for a **carousel or static image** (Siya Health brand creative), do **not** produce the full pack in one pass.

## Phase 1 — copy plan only

1. Draft on-frame copy deck in chat or `copy/carousel.md`
2. Tag clinical/stat claims **LOW / MEDIUM / HIGH**; draft `compliance/CHECKLIST.md` (see `MEDICAL-COMPLIANCE-MARKETING.md`)
3. If any checklist **Flag**, **HIGH** claim, or §7.3 Legal trigger → **STOP** for Medical Director / Legal — no render
4. No captions, video prompts, tracker rows, or WorkDrive yet
5. Stop and wait for approval before any render

## Phase 2 — one image at a time

1. Render **slide 1 only** (source photo + `compose_*.py`) — only after Phase 1 copy **and** compliance Pass (or cleared Flag)
2. Show it in chat; self-audit: Style Lock tokens · soft dissolve · lean A-03 · face-safe · right-weighted · educational footer intact
3. Wait for approval before slide 2+
4. If the user locks style (“rest look good, continue”), later slides may batch

## Phase 3 — only after the user says “approved”

When (and only when) the user explicitly approves:

1. Remaining slides if needed
2. Captions · video-prompt · tracker row · final `compliance/CHECKLIST.md` · `SHIP.md` (phase 3 + approved + `ship_lane`) — under `editorial-packs/[ID]/` or `statics/[ID]/`
3. Agents **do not** call Zoho APIs or hold refresh tokens
4. **Ship by agent type** (see `zoho-workdrive-team.mdc`):
   - **Mac / local:** `SHIP.md` → `ship_lane: mac` · TrueSync-write into existing `04` · `05-Carousels/` · `06-Statics/` · `07-Video-Prompts/`. Action **skips**.
   - **Cloud:** `SHIP.md` → `ship_lane: cloud` · git on `main` → Action mirrors into `_API-DRY-RUN/04–07`
5. End by stating: **Pack ready in git** + Mac TrueSync path **or** cloud Action → `_API-DRY-RUN/`

## Precedence (WorkDrive)

- No WorkDrive before Phase 3 approval in chat
- Mac/local may TrueSync-write the **original** team folders after Phase 3; cloud agents must not
- `_API-DRY-RUN` = cloud/Action lane only — do not treat it as Mac primary ship
- Human gate = chat approval → `SHIP.md` + tracker on `main` (+ Mac TrueSync to `05` etc.)

## Never skip

- Do not invent layouts — classify → template ID → compose
- Do not treat `GenerateImage` output as the final branded frame
- Automated ship gates do **not** replace founder/lead visual OK **or** Medical Director / Legal when required
- Lean A-03 default: headline + one `--recognition` line only (no on-frame explanation/takeaway unless `--dense`)
- Medical compliance: `siya-medical-compliance-marketing.mdc` + `brand/MEDICAL-COMPLIANCE-MARKETING.md`
